# This project is developed and run on Linux/WSL. Pin text files to LF explicitly so a
# Windows-side git (core.autocrlf=true) can never write CRLF into the working tree or the
# history. Selective rules rather than a blanket `* text=auto`: only the file types this
# repo actually contains are declared, and anything else is left to git's own detection.
*.py    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
